<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"></path></svg></span></td></tr><tr class="border-b border-border/50 hover:bg-bg-card/50 transition-colors"><td class="font-medium px-4 py-3 text-left text-text-secondary">Native SVG charts</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center text-danger"><svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg></span></td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center text-danger"><svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg></span></td><td class="bg-accent-dim px-4 py-3 text-center"><span class="font-mono text-text-secondary text-xs">yes (zero-JS)</span></td></tr><tr class="border-b border-border/50 hover:bg-bg-card/50 transition-colors"><td class="font-medium px-4 py-3 text-left text-text-secondary">ECharts adapter</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center text-danger"><svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg></span></td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center text-danger"><svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg></span></td><td class="bg-accent-dim px-4 py-3 text-center"><span class="font-mono text-text-secondary text-xs">yes (opt-in)</span></td></tr><tr class="border-b border-border/50 hover:bg-bg-card/50 transition-colors"><td class="font-medium px-4 py-3 text-left text-text-secondary">Standalone library</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center text-danger"><svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg></span></td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center text-danger"><svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg></span></td><td class="bg-accent-dim px-4 py-3 text-center"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center text-success"><svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"></path></svg></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></section> <section class="py-24 relative" data-animate><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6"><div><div class="mb-12 text-center"><div class="font-mono inline-block mb-3 text-accent text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase">Use Cases</div><h2 class="font-bold mb-4 text-[clamp(1.625rem,4vw,2.25rem)] text-text-primary tracking-tight">Built for real Go apps.</h2><p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-base text-text-secondary">Drop in components for admin panels, forms, and SaaS interfaces.</p></div><div class="gap-3 grid sm:grid-cols-3"><div class="backdrop-blur-sm bg-bg-card border border-border duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-border-hover p-6 rounded-xl text-center transition-all"><div class="bg-accent-dim border border-border-accent flex h-11 items-center justify-center mb-3 mx-auto rounded-lg text-accent w-11"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 6A2.25 2.25 0 016 3.75h2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0110.5 6v2.25a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H6a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6zM3.75 15.75A2.25 2.25 0 016 13.5h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 012.25 2.25V18a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H6A2.25 2.25 0 013.75 18v-2.25zM13.5 6a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25H18A2.25 2.25 0 0120.25 6v2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0118 10.5h-2.25a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6zM13.5 15.75a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25H18a2.25 2.25 0 012.25 2.25V18A2.25 2.25 0 0118 20.25h-2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0113.5 18v-2.25z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-semibold mb-1 text-sm text-text-primary">Admin Dashboards</h3><p class="leading-relaxed text-text-muted text-xs">Tables, stat cards, charts, and sidebars. Build data-dense panels in minutes, not days.</p></div><div class="backdrop-blur-sm bg-bg-card border border-border duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-border-hover p-6 rounded-xl text-center transition-all"><div class="bg-accent-dim border border-border-accent flex h-11 items-center justify-center mb-3 mx-auto rounded-lg text-accent w-11"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.666 3.888A2.25 2.25 0 0013.5 2.25h-3c-1.03 0-1.9.693-2.166 1.638m7.332 0c.055.194.084.4.084.612v0a.75.75 0 01-.75.75H9a.75.75 0 01-.75-.75v0c0-.212.03-.418.084-.612m7.332 0c.646.049 1.288.11 1.927.184 1.1.128 1.907 1.077 1.907 2.185V19.5a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H6.75A2.25 2.25 0 014.5 19.5V6.257c0-1.108.806-2.057 1.907-2.185a48.208 48.208 0 011.927-.184"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-semibold mb-1 text-sm text-text-primary">Forms &amp; CRUD</h3><p class="leading-relaxed text-text-muted text-xs">22 form components with validation, comboboxes, date pickers, and accessible error handling.</p></div><div class="backdrop-blur-sm bg-bg-card border border-border duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-border-hover p-6 rounded-xl text-center transition-all"><div class="bg-accent-dim border border-border-accent flex h-11 items-center justify-center mb-3 mx-auto rounded-lg text-accent w-11"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 6.75h16.5M3.75 12h16.5m-16.5 5.25h16.5"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-semibold mb-1 text-sm text-text-primary">SaaS Interfaces</h3><p class="leading-relaxed text-text-muted text-xs">Navigation, modals, drawers, tabs, and breadcrumbs. Full app chrome without a frontend framework.</p></div></div></div></div></section> <section class="py-24 relative" data-animate><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6"><div><div class="mb-12 text-center"><div class="font-mono inline-block mb-3 text-accent text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase">Get Started</div><h2 class="font-bold mb-4 text-[clamp(1.625rem,4vw,2.25rem)] text-text-primary tracking-tight">Install in 30 seconds.</h2><p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-base text-text-secondary">go get, templ generate, ship. No Node.js required.</p></div><div class="text-center"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 items-center justify-center"><a href="/getting-started/installation" class="bg-accent border-none cursor-pointer duration-200 font-semibold gap-2 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-accent-hover hover:shadow-accent/30 inline-flex items-center no-underline px-7 py-3.5 rounded-lg shadow-accent/20 shadow-lg text-sm text-white transition-all">Read the Docs<svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"></path></svg></a> <a href="/api-reference" class="border border-border duration-200 font-medium gap-2 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-border-hover hover:text-text-primary inline-flex items-center no-underline px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg text-sm text-text-secondary transition-all">API Reference<svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 6H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 8.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0018 18.75V10.5m-10.5 6L21 3m0 0h-5.25M21 3v5.25"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer role="contentinfo" class="border-border border-t mt-24" data-animate><div class="border-b border-border"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-10"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 items-start justify-between md:flex-row md:items-center"><div class="max-w-md"><h2 class="font-semibold text-lg text-text-primary">LarsArtmann Newsletter</h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text-muted">Major releases and new open-source projects across all LarsArtmann work. No spam, unsubscribe anytime.</p></div><form id="newsletter-form" action="https://buttondown.email/api/emails/embed-subscribe/larsartmann" method="POST" target="popupwindow" class="flex gap-3 items-center md:w-auto w-full"><input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="you@example.com" aria-label="Email address" class="bg-bg-elevated border border-border duration-150 flex-1 focus:border-accent focus:outline-none md:w-64 placeholder:text-text-muted px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm text-text-primary transition-colors"> <button type="submit" class="bg-accent border-none cursor-pointer duration-200 font-semibold hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-accent-hover hover:shadow-accent/30 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg shadow-accent/20 shadow-lg text-sm text-white transition-all whitespace-nowrap">Subscribe</button></form></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 items-center justify-between max-w-7xl md:flex-row mx-auto px-6 py-12"><div class="flex gap-2.5 items-center"><svg class="h-5 w-5" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" ar